  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "title": "Final Project: Responsible AI Use Guide",
    "long_instructions": "The following description is provided for students in the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DlPA8XSLKFaWIeBzc8nC5q0V-e0wC2B2xsCyXFMlKQw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unit Project Guide</a>:\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 15px; margin: 20px 0px;\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- Icon -->\r\n  <img src=\"https://images.code.org/3f2b3d032f7e00c6710aaac790be927f-image-1772831348884.png\"\r\n       alt=\"\"\r\n       style=\"width: 80px; height: auto; flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- Callout Box -->\r\n  <div style=\"background-color: #B7E0E5; padding: 0px 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100%;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n## Project Overview\r\n\r\n**Generate and Judge** is a project about learning how to stay in control of powerful tools. AI is already part of your world. It is in the systems you use to stream music, get video recommendations, and the tools you use every day. But most people use AI without ever asking: What is this, actually? And what do I think about it? \r\n\r\nThink of yourself as the artist, and AI as your paint-by-number kit. An artist uses their brushes, paint, and sketches to create their own unique art. This unit is about learning to be creative and think critically with AI. You will create a guide or poster that shares tips and guidance so others can too. \r\n\r\nYou will add to your project step by step through the lessons as you explore, experiment, and learn more about thinking critically about AI. By the end of the unit, your project will include:\r\n\r\n<!-- Top Row -->\r\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; margin:20px 0px 10px 0px; text-align:center;\">\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"width:48%; border:1px solid #048899; border-radius:10px; padding:16px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:0;\">\r\n      Collected Evidence\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0;\">\r\n      Experiment with AI tools and collect real evidence of what works well and what doesn't\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"width:48%; border:1px solid #048899; border-radius:10px; padding:16px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:0;\">\r\n      AI Guidance\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0;\">\r\n      Create your own guidance for responsible AI use, backed by what you discovered.\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- Bottom Row -->\r\n<div style=\"margin:10px 0px 20px 0px; text-align:center;\">\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"width:100%; border:1px solid #048899; border-radius:10px; padding:16px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:0;\">\r\n      Your Questions, Explanations and Reflections\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0;\">\r\n      Test the tools, explore new ideas, ask questions and make your own judgments along the way\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n## Example Guides\r\n\r\n📎 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Hb6D3ohPC7uicvVNO7V7fvLVeQXx_4aJplO5HYrHuR8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Resource: Example Guides</a>\r\n\r\nLook through the example guides in the resource above. Students will peruse similar guides as inspiration for their own **Responsible AI Use Guides**. While you browse the slide deck, consider the following:\r\n\r\n* What will pique my students' interest from the sample guides?\r\n* What will my students excel at in creating their own guides? What will I need to do to support their development of a guide?\r\n\r\nJot your answers in the open response box below.\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;\">\r\n<strong>Note:</strong> Click and drag the bottom-right corner of the reflection box below to expand it.\r\n</p>",
